  "conclusion_tr": "US_CPI i\u00e7in test edilen 16 duyarl\u0131l\u0131k kombinasyonundan 14'\u00fc ge\u00e7erli bulunmu\u015f, 2'si yetersiz mum \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc (4h mum - 6h pencere) nedeniyle ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l\u0131nm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Ge\u00e7erli 14 h\u00fccrenin t\u00fcm\u00fcnde (%100.0) nokta tahmini pozitif y\u00f6nl\u00fc olmakla birlikte, istatistiksel g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 teyit oran\u0131 %85.71'tir. 4h-48h Close-to-Close h\u00fccresinde g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 1.0 seviyesini kapsad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in etki istatistiksel olarak desteklenmemektedir.",
